{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "a1027c6d9676219b1c159bb175dfc464415c3b80fc177347a19bfc28a1dde77d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　新しい衣装を\n着てみたんだけども……どうだろか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我试着穿了新服装……觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5609f0c6c2787da234141e4dd55c8af3c1e7c08868273ec1c471eae9f810dba6", "ja": "うん、大丈夫。よく似合ってるぞ！\n髪型も元気な感じでいいと思う。", "zh": "嗯，没问题。非常适合你哦！\n发型也很有活力，感觉很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "9ea701d07734ccdf2ad52120fbd5cddb8307da4f3de0d816371455f1bf841dbc", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとね。この衣装を見てたら、\n弟と一緒に見てたアニメを思い出したんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你。看到这身服装，我想起了和弟弟一起看的动画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "b0c345f76bb1271a269ce3b1b0f10d09e1e2252b8039276cf6837d89a90db1c8", "ja": "その中でめんこい女の子が、似たような服を着ててね。\n髪型も、ちょっこしまねっこしてみたんだわ。", "zh": "其中有个可爱的女孩子穿着类似的衣服。\n我还稍微学了学她的发型呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c82ea6c8e50f4e6296e747dec1790c33e2e8e390edf9b19f27bb1329e2dac43c", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nアニメを一緒に見るなんて仲がいいな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。会一起看动画，关系真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "8a6a832ebb502e1a159fae7652aded05c9e8c3d851d2552894601b475c7d5e31", "ja": "うん。最初は弟が見てたんだ。それであたしも\nなんとなく見てたら、夢中になっちゃって……。", "zh": "嗯。一开始是弟弟在看。后来我也不知不觉跟着看了，结果就入迷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "15c533cc45224d2c2d52c8cb65fd85109802c566bf10f8be367d45175261b938", "ja": "まねっこした女の子は、どんな時も前向きに頑張る\nとっても素敵な子なんだよぉ。", "zh": "我模仿的那个女孩子，是个无论何时都积极努力、\n非常棒的女孩哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4560e384aea90f10fbd70a4ec7c5718317d20d9729a983faf055defdb2e4a6be", "ja": "そうなんだな。なるほど……ひなたがマネしたのは、\n髪型だけじゃないってことだな！", "zh": "原来是这样。也就是说……小日向模仿的，不只是发型啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "7524860c454730136bd5d88682065e17e8892c1fec9f5f61498bd6945a0e7e29", "ja": "んー？\nどういうことだい、{$P$}？", "zh": "嗯——？\n这是什么意思呀，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ebe9457f139b500b47f94b7bc364e416cbf8c86bb31624fd170bc5b24e0b60a5", "ja": "ひなたは、いつも前向きに頑張るだろう？\n今の話を聞いて、その理由が少し見えた気がしたんだ。", "zh": "日向总是积极努力，对吧？\n听了刚才那番话，我好像有点明白她为什么会这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "f7140ccc3ce41bffbb835f9e81381048509377f84aa0717e88107b277801f347", "ja": "そんな風に言われると、なんだか恥ずかしいべさ。\nあんまり気にしてなかったけども……。", "zh": "你这么一说，弄得人家都有点不好意思了。以前倒是没怎么在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "f2443a8d358bbc7e35c4b6ba7423aed9e9e9127a8ed6f0046baad672f83bf862", "ja": "もしかしたら、憧れてたのかもしれないね。\nあの子みたいな素敵な女の子に……。", "zh": "说不定，我其实一直都很憧憬呢。\n憧憬成为像那个孩子一样棒的女孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1012_p", "source_sha256": "573ab20eb3d1033917fd1ce263b588947dce364626193d8d675ad5969308ce84", "ja": "ひなた……。アニメのキャラクターも、\nそういう意味ではアイドルと一緒かもな。", "zh": "日向……。从某种意义上来说，动画角色或许也和偶像一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ad765def3774a43f093eebfc2ac1a0dbce11f3b9e1a04379faefcdc1cf43882d", "ja": "見る人に夢や勇気を与えたり、感情を動かしたり……。\n誰かの心に寄り添うところは同じだと思うんだ。", "zh": "给看的人带来梦想和勇气，触动他们的情感……\n能够贴近某个人内心这一点，我觉得是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "1ce69271e47e0b770d09674db64d0568ef8f3693f25f2285d9a5fb388024c413", "ja": "確かに、そうだねぇ。{$P$}って、\nなんだか……ゲジマユ博士に似てるね。", "zh": "确实，是这样呢。{$P$}，\n总感觉……和浓眉博士有点像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "80643b406c05a2a3da89ab0dfad4cdb38ab0307f47ae873da5b29330192f3934", "ja": "えっ？　ゲジマユ博士？", "zh": "诶？　ゲジ眉博士？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "ee0e367c039e3504291bac704edcdcf7ca2cf153146d4c4bd413ae499d70618b", "ja": "あ、ゲジマユ博士っていうのはね、\n弟と見たアニメに出てくる頭のいい博士なんだ。", "zh": "啊，所谓“蜈蚣眉博士”，\n就是我和弟弟一起看的动画里登场的聪明博士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "07000ce740eeab2e84e979a631b4c73c3378962db05a67444ecf6186fb1591bf", "ja": "いつもいろんなことに気づいて、主人公を支えてくれる\n……アニメに欠かせない人なんだよぉ。", "zh": "总能注意到各种事情，支持着主人公……\n是动画里不可或缺的人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "25a8805afc2a7449f1b4a92dce9897a757842c83e875308974564452f9ba3eb4", "ja": "ははっ。そんなすごい人と似てるだなんて光栄だよ。\nなんか内容が気になるし、そのアニメ見てみようかな。", "zh": "哈哈，能和那么厉害的人相像，真是我的荣幸。\n感觉还挺让人在意内容的，我也去看看那部动画吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "a1c6f44e37d4f7b7358eb5da1c71cb2b8aa9a1bff7293cc5fd7b3d892d2114f0", "ja": "{$P$}もかい？\nあたしも、もう一度見たいなぁって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "{$P$}也要看吗？\n我也正想着再看一遍呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ae9d869fb746b6ede150ab2df69b3542d4bb2177de73e4a2793723a399d94d1c", "ja": "お、ひなたもか？\nそれじゃ、今度一緒に見ようか。", "zh": "哦，日向也是吗？\n那下次一起看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0324_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "a8c9bb560337aff8446e05cf8e5d1039429f0f0eddca2462e8468da7eb12c87d", "ja": "いいのかい、{$P$}？　またあの子や\n博士に会えるなんて……楽しみだなぁ、ふふ。", "zh": "真的可以吗，{$P$}？　又能见到那个孩子\n还有博士了……好期待呀，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
